#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:291
msgid "Default module order"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin-design-studio-renderer.php:293
msgid ""
"What it does: Order of the 5 heading blocks in the popup header (comma-"
"separated). E.g. media,impact,urgency,social_proof,progress. Unknown IDs are "
"ignored. The form body is fixed: donor → dedication → amount → processing "
